# Fuel 2.0 — General

**Canonical repo guide:** `CLAUDE.md` at repo root. Read it for commands, architecture, auth, DB, and gaps.

**Product:** York IE portfolio / pipeline / value-creation platform. Monorepo: `apps/web` (Next.js 15), `packages/infrastructure` (CDK). `apps/agents` (Go ADK) **not scaffolded yet**.

## Engineering
- Reusable composable components; business logic separate from UI; search before creating
- Strict TypeScript; no `any`; `@/*` imports; remove unused imports
- No dead code; small focused functions; comments only when non-obvious

## Migration / design changes
- Replicate UX; adapt to this repo; reuse `theme.ts` / atoms / existing patterns
- Do not change York palette (`#284256`, `#00B48A`, `#ECD67F`) without design evidence
- Design prototype is **not in repo** — see `CLAUDE.md` § Working with the design source

## Before building (check CLAUDE.md § Things that don't exist yet)
- No `apps/agents`, Playwright specs, users table, or MCP token rotation — see `techstack.md` for targets

## AI workflow
**Before:** read `CLAUDE.md` + search primitives · **During:** match conventions · **After:** typecheck/lint, remove dead code
